Today is a beautiful Sunday morning.
I am making a tea in the kitchen.
I am boiling water.
I place my phone there.
I make a video call to Mexico.
My mother answers the call.
For them, it is night there now.
Mother asks, "Maya, what are you doing?"
I say, "Mom, I am making a tea."
There is good sunlight in Kochi now.
There is a lot of light in my kitchen.
Mother sees that light.
Mother asks, "Whose kitchen is this?"
Mother says, "There is a lot of light there."
I smile happily.
I turn my phone.
I show my new room to mom.
I say, "This is my new house in Kochi."
